on November&nbsp;20, 2024 from the Swiss biopharmaceutical company NLS Pharmaceutics Ltd (&ldquo;NLS&rdquo;). This amount represents
a current account between the Company and NLS intended for the settlement of future shared costs related to the merger transaction. The
unused balance of the current account will be settled upon completion of the merger.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

