<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">D.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">On February&nbsp;19, 2020, the Company completed a material
private placement, offering:</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&nbsp;</P>

